<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2208_8331.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig dienst, unnd was wir ehren,
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guets vermögend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuevor</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">From</unclear>, fürsichtig,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsunders</unclear> guet fründt, unnd getrüw lieb
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnossen</unclear>. Unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwÿflet</unclear> nit, dann
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">das</unclear> üch unnseren lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnossen</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-528" cert="medium" resp="#ner">fünff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eewig</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">en</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rÿchsstetten</unclear></orgName> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-135" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Augspurg</placeName>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-21" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nuernberg</unclear></placeName>, <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-16" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Franckfurt</placeName>,
<lb n="7"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-112" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Straßburg</placeName> unnd <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-28" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Ulm</placeName> deputierten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nechstverwüchner</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>tagen deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müntzwäßens</unclear> halber von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-135" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Augspurg</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uß</unclear>, auch
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ebenmässig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegeschriben</unclear> worden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿn</unclear>, wie
<lb n="10"/>gegen unnseren lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnossen</unclear> der Statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-185" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Schaff-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußen</unclear></placeName> unnd unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschechen</unclear>. Darüber
<lb n="12"/>nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwahren</unclear> sÿ <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnossen</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-185" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Schaffhußen</placeName>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">meinung</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erclerung</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetzt</unclear> von unns
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferners</unclear> begehrt. Demnach aber inn dem
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verfasseten</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">übergschickten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müntz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">edict</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sorten</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>eben hoch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">valviert</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewerdet</unclear>, unnd wir noch
<lb n="17"/>nit wüssen mögend, ob es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> ein bestandt haben
<lb n="18"/>werde, unnd sunderlich ob es uff jüngst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgewäßener</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><date resp="#ner">Franckfurter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fastenmeß</unclear></date> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darbÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verblÿben</unclear> mögen,
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">old</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darmit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschaffen</unclear>, so habent wir
<lb n="21"/>unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierüber</unclear> gegen inen noch zur <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zÿt</unclear> nützit ent-
<lb n="22"/>schliessen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khönnen</unclear>, sunders die sach ingestelt, biß
<lb n="23"/>man gründtlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vernemmen</unclear> mag, wie es uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedachter</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Franckfurter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Meß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiermit</unclear> abgangen, unnd es sich
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzüchen</unclear> mögen werde, damit demnach die sachen
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ferners</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dest</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rÿfflicher</unclear> bedacht, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besserer</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestendigheit</unclear> gebracht werden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">möchten</unclear>. Und
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diewÿl</unclear> dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> erachtens hierzue ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemeine</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuesammenkhunfft</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berathschlagung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">not</unclear>-
<lb n="30"/>wendig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿn</unclear> wirt. Als <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdent</unclear> ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underzwüsch</unclear>-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ent</unclear> unnd biß ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllichs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschechen</unclear> mag, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferner</unclear>-
<lb n="32"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erhöchung</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">steigerung</unclear> deß gelts, dann es
<lb n="33"/>aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear> landen noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bißher</unclear> gangbar <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewäßen</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zehoch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnug</unclear> ist, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bÿ</unclear> üch unnd den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerigen</unclear>,
<lb n="35"/>so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">immer</unclear> möglich, auch wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorzesÿn</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuebe</unclear>-
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gegnen</unclear> wüssen, wie wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ebenmessig</unclear> auch thuen werd-
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ent</unclear>. Unnd dessen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsere</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnossen</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-185" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Schaff-
<lb n="38"/>hußen</placeName> uff ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obangedüt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrÿben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glÿchergstalt</unclear> ver-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stendiget</unclear> habent. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wolt</unclear> bitende, das
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2208_8332.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">er</unclear> alles <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlichs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versechen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soll</unclear>; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herre</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßeren</unclear>,
<lb n="41"/>unnd unns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeinlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wÿther</unclear> inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿnem</unclear> schirm er=
<lb n="42"/>halten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welle</unclear>. Datum <origDate when="1620" resp="#ner">den 19 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear>. Aprilis,
<lb n="43"/>anno 1620</origDate>.
<lb n="44"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rhatt
<lb n="45"/>der statt Zürich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2208_8333.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2208_8334.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="46"/>Den frommen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear>,
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrßammen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burg-
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ermeister</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear> der
<lb n="49"/>Statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>, unnß-
<lb n="50"/>eren innsonders guoten
